{"id":"87b1d4bf7c9d6143","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-basic-machine.md","title":"Shoenfield Basic Machine","display":"df-basic-machine — Shoenfield Basic Machine","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-basic-machine","aliases":["68-df-basic-machine"],"display":"df-basic-machine — Shoenfield Basic Machine","depends_on":["[[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§3 pp.3-5 / PDF 12-14","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"not-checked","revision_basis":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-basic-machine"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-basic-machine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-basic-machine — Shoenfield Basic Machine"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c524671590651be2\" href=\"?note=c524671590651be2\" title=\"68-df-number-theoretic-function\">68-df-number-theoretic-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§3 pp.3-5 / PDF 12-14"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-checked"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c524671590651be2\" href=\"?note=c524671590651be2\" title=\"68-df-number-theoretic-function\">68-df-number-theoretic-function</a> 的自然数与有限元组。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lh}(P)\">\\(\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\)</span> 是有限序列长度，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(q)\">\\(P(q)\\)</span> 为其第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 项，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R\">\\(\\mathcal R\\)</span> 为寄存器状态集。转移条款在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathcal P\">\\(P\\in\\mathcal P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q,i,v\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(q,i,v\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathcal R\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathcal R\\)</span> 下使用；寄存器更新在下式定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_P\">\\(\\delta_P\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal R\">\\(\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal R\\)</span>，函数调用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_P(q,\\rho)\">\\(\\delta_P(q,\\rho)\\)</span> 以有序对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(q,\\rho)\">\\((q,\\rho)\\)</span> 为单个配置输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho[i\\leftarrow v]:=(\\rho\\restriction(\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{i\\}))\\cup\\{(i,v)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho[i\\leftarrow v]:=(\\rho\\restriction(\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{i\\}))\\cup\\{(i,v)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R:=\\{\\rho\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}:|\\{i:\\rho(i)\\ne0\\}|&lt;\\aleph_0\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal I:=\\{(0,i):i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\cup\\{(1,i,n):i,n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\cup\\{(2,n):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal R:=\\{\\rho\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}:|\\{i:\\rho(i)\\ne0\\}|&lt;\\aleph_0\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal I:=\\{(0,i):i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\cup\\{(1,i,n):i,n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\cup\\{(2,n):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P:=\\{P\\in\\mathcal I^{&lt;\\omega}:\\forall q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\;\\forall i,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;((P(q)=(1,i,n)\\lor P(q)=(2,n))\\Rightarrow n&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P:=\\{P\\in\\mathcal I^{&lt;\\omega}:\\forall q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\;\\forall i,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;((P(q)=(1,i,n)\\lor P(q)=(2,n))\\Rightarrow n&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\delta_P(q,\\rho):=\\begin{cases}\n(q,\\rho)&amp;q\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(P),\\\\\n(q+1,\\rho[i\\leftarrow\\rho(i)+1])&amp;q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(0,i),\\\\\n(n,\\rho[i\\leftarrow\\rho(i)-1])&amp;q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(1,i,n)\\land\\rho(i)&gt;0,\\\\\n(q+1,\\rho)&amp;q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(1,i,n)\\land\\rho(i)=0,\\\\\n(n,\\rho)&amp;q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(2,n).\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\delta_P(q,\\rho):=\\begin{cases}\n(q,\\rho)&amp;q\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(P),\\\\\n(q+1,\\rho[i\\leftarrow\\rho(i)+1])&amp;q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(0,i),\\\\\n(n,\\rho[i\\leftarrow\\rho(i)-1])&amp;q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(1,i,n)\\land\\rho(i)&gt;0,\\\\\n(q+1,\\rho)&amp;q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(1,i,n)\\land\\rho(i)=0,\\\\\n(n,\\rho)&amp;q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(2,n).\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 §3，印刷 pp.3–5 / PDF pp.12–14。三种指令分别是 INCREASE、DECREASE、GO TO。特别注意：DECREASE 在寄存器非零时减一并跳转，在零时顺序执行下一指令。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_P\">\\(\\delta_P\\)</span> 在停机状态作恒等延续只是为了给出全函数迭代，停机输出仍取第一次到达程序尾后的状态。每个分支覆盖唯一指令，且有限支撑性在一步执行下保持。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-number-theoretic-function","status":"resolved","id":"c524671590651be2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-number-theoretic-function","status":"resolved","id":"c524671590651be2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[68-df-number-theoretic-function]] 的自然数与有限元组。$\\operatorname{lh}(P)$ 是有限序列长度，$P(q)$ 为其第 $q$ 项，$\\mathcal R$ 为寄存器状态集。转移条款在 $P\\in\\mathcal P$、$q,i,v\\in\\mathbb N$、$\\rho\\in\\mathcal R$ 下使用；寄存器更新在下式定义。$\\delta_P$ 的定义域为 $\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal R$，函数调用 $\\delta_P(q,\\rho)$ 以有序对 $(q,\\rho)$ 为单个配置输入。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{lh}(P)","display":false},{"tex":"P(q)","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in\\mathcal P","display":false},{"tex":"q,i,v\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in\\mathcal R","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal R","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_P(q,\\rho)","display":false},{"tex":"(q,\\rho)","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho[i\\leftarrow v]:=(\\rho\\restriction(\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{i\\}))\\cup\\{(i,v)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal R:=\\{\\rho\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}:|\\{i:\\rho(i)\\ne0\\}|<\\aleph_0\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal I:=\\{(0,i):i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\cup\\{(1,i,n):i,n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\cup\\{(2,n):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P:=\\{P\\in\\mathcal I^{<\\omega}:\\forall q<\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\;\\forall i,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;((P(q)=(1,i,n)\\lor P(q)=(2,n))\\Rightarrow n<\\operatorname{lh}(P))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\delta_P(q,\\rho):=\\begin{cases}\n(q,\\rho)&q\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(P),\\\\\n(q+1,\\rho[i\\leftarrow\\rho(i)+1])&q<\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(0,i),\\\\\n(n,\\rho[i\\leftarrow\\rho(i)-1])&q<\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(1,i,n)\\land\\rho(i)>0,\\\\\n(q+1,\\rho)&q<\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(1,i,n)\\land\\rho(i)=0,\\\\\n(n,\\rho)&q<\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(2,n).\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\delta_P","display":false}],"bytes":2275,"backlinks":[{"id":"89e092f6450e5227","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathcal P$、$\\rho\\in\\mathcal R$ 及 $\\delta_P$ 见 [[68-df-basic-machine]]。$k,t\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\in\\mathbb N^k$。$i,q\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\pi_0,\\pi_1$ 的共同定义域为 $\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal R$，函数值在下式给出。$\\rho_{k,\\vec x}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$，$C(P,k,\\vec x,\\cdot):\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal R$ 由下式定义。"},{"id":"124259d2584af1b6","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$e,x,y,s,t,q,i,j,n\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\chi_A$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-set]]；$\\mathcal I,\\mathcal R$ 及寄存器更新见 [[68-df-basic-machine]]，$\\rho_{1,x}$ 见 [[68-df-basic-machine-computation]]。有限序列编码 $\\operatorname{sc}$ 见 [[68-df-sequence-code]]。"},{"id":"985351114b7734a0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal P$、$\\mathcal I$ 见 [[68-df-basic-machine]]；$\\operatorname{sc}$、$\\operatorname{sd}$ 见 [[68-df-sequence-code]]。有限指令元组按其分量次序视为有限自然数序列。$e\\in\\mathbb N$，$P\\in\\mathcal P$；$()$ 是空程序。$\\operatorname{pc}$ 的定义域为 $\\mathcal P$，值域包含于 $\\mathbb N$。"},{"id":"45acd372bb8b9947","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\vec\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B^m$，$\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k$。$\\mathcal I,\\mathcal R$ 见 [[68-df-basic-machine]]。初态 $\\rho_{k,\\vec x}$ 见 [[68-df-basic-machine-computation]]，将该处 $x_1,\\ldots,x_k$ 依次取为本处 $x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1}$。$P$ 是下式定义的程序，$q,t\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\rho\\in\\mathcal R$。实寄存器编号 $r$ 从 $0$ 开始；$\\rho[i\\leftarrow v]$ 为单点更新。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-basic-machine]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-basic-machine]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"数值函数与基本机器：[[68-df-number-theoretic-function]] → [[68-df-basic-machine]] → [[68-df-basic-machine-computation]] → [[68-df-program-index]] → [[68-df-kleene-t-predicate]] → [[68-df-kleene-normal-form]]。"}],"outgoing":["c524671590651be2"]}